WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.320
A repeatable test environment runs
real software with controlled inputs.

00:00:04.340 --> 00:00:07.200
The proposed runner checks
the payment service and a real

00:00:07.271 --> 00:00:10.640
database against an isolated
fixture and provider model.

00:00:10.840 --> 00:00:16.360
The lifecycle includes readiness,
reset, retained evidence and cleanup.

00:00:16.480 --> 00:00:19.520
Failures remain failures after
the environment is removed.

00:00:19.616 --> 00:00:22.960
Keep provider and settlement
integration evidence separately.

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:25.920
Another engineer should
be able to reproduce

00:00:25.940 --> 00:00:28.160
the result from the same manifest.
